        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skull8 is a small retro-inspired fantasy experiment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a procedurally generated labyrinth in search of eight mythical relics. Every screen hides traps, secrets, and subtle clues for the observant.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated labyrinth full of mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight relics of forgotten power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom 12×12 Char Set text-graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards for competitive explorers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;Skull8 began as a way to introduce my 8-year-old son to programming. We started in BASIC on the Amstrad CPC, but soon ran into the limits of that old machine. So I ported the project to PC, expanded it, and now, it has found its way onto Steam.&gt;&gt;</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skull8 is a small retro-inspired fantasy experiment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a procedurally generated labyrinth in search of eight mythical relics. Every screen hides traps, secrets, and subtle clues for the observant.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated labyrinth full of mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight relics of forgotten power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom 12×12 Char Set text-graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards for competitive explorers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;&lt;Skull8 began as a way to introduce my 8-year-old son to programming. We started in BASIC on the Amstrad CPC, but soon ran into the limits of that old machine. So I ported the project to PC, expanded it, and now, it has found its way onto Steam.&gt;&gt;</p>",
        "short_description": "A 12-minute hunt for eight lost relics in a procedurally generated labyrinth. Think Minesweeper meets dark fantasy, with leaderboards for the brave.",
